>
  <h2>Your Journey Starts Here</h2>
  <p>Starting with Fitclo is simple. This <strong>quick-start guide to ordering private label stock</strong> will take you from catalog browsing to branded products in a few easy steps.</p>
  
  <h3>Step 1: Browse the Catalog</h3>
  <p>Contact our sales team to receive our latest digital catalog. Select the styles, colors, and sizes that fit your brand vision.</p>
  
  <h3>Step 2: Submit Branding Assets</h3>
  <p>Send us your logo in vector format (.AI or .EPS). Our design team will provide digital mockups showing the placement on your selected garments.</p>
  
  <h3>Step 3: Approval and Production</h3>
  <p>Once you approve the mockups, we apply your heat-transfer logos, custom tags, and packaging. With ready-to-ship stock, this process is incredibly fast.</p>
  
  <h3>Step 4: Quality Check and Shipping</h3>
  <p>Every branded order undergoes a final quality check before being shipped from our centers in Guangzhou, Dongguan, or Yiwu directly to your warehouse.</p>

  <p>Ready to get started? Contact Fitclo today and have your own branded activewear line ready for sale in weeks.</p>
</GuideLayout>
